<h1>Build location routing with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">Los Pollos Hermanos is a fictional fried chicken chain with restaurants across the Southwest and one phone number. The caller&rsquo;s area code decides which restaurant rings, and callers it can&rsquo;t place, such as those from other area codes or other countries, pick one from a menu. It is one document published on voiceml.org, with no application server.</p>
