<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Before you start</h2>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>A VoiceML account with a phone number.</strong> See <a href="/voiceml/">VoiceML</a> or <a href="/signup/">start a free trial</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Each location&rsquo;s phone number</strong>, and the area codes that should reach it.</li>
	</ol>
	<div class="alert alert-warning" role="note">
		<p><strong>The restaurants and numbers in this document are fictional.</strong> The numbers use the 555-0100 to 555-0199 range, which is set aside for fiction. Replace them with your own locations before you publish.</p>
	</div>
